{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everhome is a tiny building game all about cozy homes and heartwarming characters. Build wholesome houses, meet new friends, and grow your small community among the clouds. Enjoy ~3 hours of story mode, or unwind in the sandbox mode and design the perfect Everhome at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/08d947285c0f91ff60ca0d6a8c792e05.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build each home from scratch, lay the foundations, raise the walls, add roofs and windows, then bring it all together with whimsical decorations that make every space feel homey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/2b109dff6bde5bd053e6a08e15104a9a.poster.avif?t=1756821676\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/2b109dff6bde5bd053e6a08e15104a9a.webm?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/2b109dff6bde5bd053e6a08e15104a9a.mp4?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/64c57b0c0b502aa9260cef8d8e1e1881.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your new friends come from many corners of the world, each with their own unique tastes and traditions. These preferences aren\u2019t always clear at first, but attentive architects will catch the small hints residents share as their homes take shape. Every clue you uncover is kept in your nifty journal, helping you shape a place each resident can truly call their own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/20e9ec0f7992b02dbb0eb780d9096f6f.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know the residents who\u2019ve chosen a life among the clouds. Increase everyone\u2019s happiness to welcome even more residents. Uncover their stories, and learn what a fresh start in the sky truly means to them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/6e080902bd61412e9580defece34eb73.poster.avif?t=1756821676\" width=780 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/6e080902bd61412e9580defece34eb73.webm?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/6e080902bd61412e9580defece34eb73.mp4?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/a3115bb2c03476e58294abcd3668c553.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the charming Skymarket, where you\u2019ll find a variety of decorations and items, some might be just what your residents have been dreaming of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/d8f0c8196abdea20f4ebe89e73952de1.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve found the perfect pieces at the Skymarket, or thought of a cuter way to arrange a house, step in and renovate. With a bit of clever management and some new decorations, each change can increase your residents\u2019 happiness and turn a simple room into a true Everhome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/4279f57dc9391a962c3ac9ca36c061c3.poster.avif?t=1756821676\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/4279f57dc9391a962c3ac9ca36c061c3.webm?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/4279f57dc9391a962c3ac9ca36c061c3.mp4?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/c41df939db8f7c4683029dac0914e409.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can expect from Everhome:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~3 hours of story mode play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of endearing characters, each with a unique story and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of decorations to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sandbox mode, no management, no rules, just pure creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing escape into a sky full of dreamy houses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936940?t=1756821676","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/6c6f8954bb773aff2d9242b66c91bc50d7f1eb49/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756821676","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/3d6f0c8ecf36ff391d79d09811b5635c04ee6b72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756821676","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/3d6f0c8ecf36ff391d79d09811b5635c04ee6b72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756821676","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everhome is a tiny building game all about cozy homes and heartwarming characters. Build wholesome houses, meet new friends, and grow your small community among the clouds. Enjoy ~3 hours of story mode, or unwind in the sandbox mode and design the perfect Everhome at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/08d947285c0f91ff60ca0d6a8c792e05.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build each home from scratch, lay the foundations, raise the walls, add roofs and windows, then bring it all together with whimsical decorations that make every space feel homey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/2b109dff6bde5bd053e6a08e15104a9a.poster.avif?t=1756821676\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/2b109dff6bde5bd053e6a08e15104a9a.webm?t=17