0902bd61412e9580defece34eb73.mp4?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/a3115bb2c03476e58294abcd3668c553.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse the charming Skymarket, where you\u2019ll find a variety of decorations and items, some might be just what your residents have been dreaming of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/d8f0c8196abdea20f4ebe89e73952de1.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve found the perfect pieces at the Skymarket, or thought of a cuter way to arrange a house, step in and renovate. With a bit of clever management and some new decorations, each change can increase your residents\u2019 happiness and turn a simple room into a true Everhome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/4279f57dc9391a962c3ac9ca36c061c3.poster.avif?t=1756821676\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/4279f57dc9391a962c3ac9ca36c061c3.webm?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/4279f57dc9391a962c3ac9ca36c061c3.mp4?t=1756821676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/extras/c41df939db8f7c4683029dac0914e409.avif?t=1756821676\" width=596 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you can expect from Everhome:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~3 hours of story mode play time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of endearing characters, each with a unique story and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of decorations to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sandbox mode, no management, no rules, just pure creativity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soothing escape into a sky full of dreamy houses</p></li></ul>","developers":["Clover Bite"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/284127289eeb8463718913ffeb6d6e63f26f6f55/header.jpg?t=1756821676","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Everhome","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (SP1+)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> X86, X64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 450 or higher with 1GB Memory<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Clover Bite"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936940/d657cc9fab17e0d278867993806396402d4eef4e/ss_d657cc9fab17e0d278867993806396402d4eef4e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756821676","path_thumbnail":