 them! Go shopping for new decorations, renovate their homes and discover the keys to their hearts.","steam_appid":3936940,"support_info":{"email":"tidbitclover@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}